## Engineering workflow (AI-DLC)

For non-trivial software work, follow `.agents/skills/ai-dlc-engineering/SKILL.md` (adjust the path if
installed elsewhere). Clarify first, write requirements, architecture, a threat model and a milestone
plan, and stop for my explicit approval at each gate. Build one milestone at a time, run the tests
yourself and show real output. Never weaken tests and never claim something works without running it.
Change `.aidlc/` only through `scripts/aidlc.py`.
